---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Terms of Service";
const description = "Terms of Service for ToolsWaala. Rules and guidelines for using our free tools.";
---

<Layout title={`${title} | ToolsWaala`} description={description} currentPath="/terms">
  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: July 21, 2026</p>
    
    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>By accessing and using ToolsWaala (https://www.toolswaala.in), you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement.</p>
    
    <h2>2. Use of License</h2>
    <p>All tools on ToolsWaala are provided 100% free of charge for personal and commercial use. You may use our generators (PDF, invoice, estimate, legal agreement) to generate documents for your personal or business needs.</p>
    
    <h2>3. Disclaimer of Liability</h2>
    <p>ToolsWaala provides these calculators and generators as-is. We do not guarantee the accuracy of calculations or legal compliance of generated documents. Under no circumstances shall ToolsWaala be liable for any direct, indirect, or consequential damages arising out of the use of our services.</p>
    
    <h2>4. Modifying Services</h2>
    <p>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any tool or service at any time without notice.</p>
  </div>

  <article class="seo-article" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2>Terms of Service & User Agreement</h2>
    <p>Welcome to ToolsWaala (https://www.toolswaala.in). By accessing or using our website, calculators, document generators, and PDF tools, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions of use.</p>

    <h3>1. Acceptance of Terms & Free Service Scope</h3>
    <p>ToolsWaala provides web-based calculators, document utility tools, and educational guides 100% free of charge. We reserve the right to modify, update, or discontinue any feature at any time without prior notice.</p>

    <h3>2. Client-Side Processing & Privacy Guarantee</h3>
    <p>All calculations, document formatting, PDF compression, and invoice generation executed on ToolsWaala occur locally within the user's web browser using HTML5, WebAssembly, and client-side JavaScript. ToolsWaala does not store, transmit, or record confidential user inputs or uploaded documents on remote servers.</p>

    <h3>3. Disclaimer of Warranties & Financial Liability</h3>
    <p>While ToolsWaala strives to maintain 100% accuracy across all university CGPA formulas, GST tax rates, EMI interest calculations, and legal contract templates, all content and tools are provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis. ToolsWaala shall not be held liable for any financial losses, tax penalties, academic discrepancies, or legal claims resulting from the use of our website.</p>

    <h3>4. Intellectual Property Rights</h3>
    <p>All website branding, logos, custom design system code, and proprietary software interfaces belong exclusively to ToolsWaala. Users are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use generated invoices, PDFs, and certificates for personal or business purposes.</p>

    <h3>5. Governing Law & Jurisdiction</h3>
    <p>These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising out of or in connection with the use of ToolsWaala shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts located in New Delhi, India.</p>
  
    <h3>ToolsWaala Quality Assurance & Feedback Guidelines</h3>
    <p>We take software accuracy, user data privacy, and web accessibility extremely seriously. ToolsWaala is built following W3C accessibility guidelines, ISO security practices, and modern Core Web Vitals performance benchmarks. Every calculator and generator is audited regularly against revised government tax notifications (CGST/SGST/IGST), Reserve Bank of India (RBI) payment directives, and University Grants Commission (UGC) academic mandates.</p>
    <p>If you encounter any calculation discrepancy, broken link, or rendering glitch on your mobile device or browser, please report it directly to our technical operations desk at <code>info@toolswaala.in</code>. Include your device type, operating system version, and screenshot if available to help our engineering team reproduce and deploy a instant hotfix within 24 hours.</p>

</article>

</Layout>
